# WO-6.1/6.4: the gallery PNGs are a BUILD ARTIFACT, not a tracked binary.
# Playwright regenerates them on `test:e2e`; build-gallery.mjs assembles
# gallery.html from them. NOTHING byte-compares these PNGs (no snapshot/baseline
# anywhere; the e2e asserts capture success, build-gallery asserts existence), so
# byte-equality is a property nothing relies on — the WO-4.1 hazard (a *tracked*
# PNG re-encoding and dirtying the tree) is gone because the COMPARISON is gone.
